# vhs tape: the README demo GIF. Runs against the fabricated demo catalog
# (demo_seed.py data) — no real mail appears. Render with:
#   cd bench && vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 920
Set Height 340
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type `./ask "what's my auto loan agreement number?"`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 15s
Sleep 4s
